Subject: [PATCH] Serialize IMS bearer requests across modem recovery

Upstream: 81voltd v1.2.0 (7c0cd9442d71b55260c9917c89ebc4bd20e283a8)
Status: downstream; upstream main a7794dd6 inspected 2026-09-07

Acknowledge firmware handles promptly, wait for MM readiness, bound transient
connection retries and report terminal failures using the existing indication.
Cancel stopped requests without losing late CreateBearer results and guard
callbacks against MM owner/generation replacement. Test production sources on
private D-Bus and a wrapped QRTR transport, including actual IMSD wire messages.

